config SERVICE_APP_GLANCES
    bool "App glances"
    help
      App-glances (launcher tile) service.

config APP_GLANCE_ON_DEMAND
    bool "Allocate the app glance only while it is reloaded"
    help
      Keep an app's glance (over 1 KiB) in its heap only while
      app_glance_reload() runs, instead of in the app state for the whole
      life of the app. For boards whose app state is otherwise too large
      for the app runtime of their platform. A reload that finds no memory
      logs an error and leaves the glance as it was.
